scn LIMGSResidentScript

; On every Goodsprings resident the mod adds (docs/towns-design.md, "Fights"): the player hurting
; or killing one of them is noticed by the town. Infamy is vanilla Goodsprings reputation, so the
; town's reactions and vanilla dialogue both follow it. Once per resident for a hit, once more for
; a death.

int iHit
int iDead

begin OnHit player
	if iHit == 0
		set iHit to 1
		AddReputation RepNVGoodsprings 0 1
	endif
end

begin OnDeath player
	if iDead == 0
		set iDead to 1
		AddReputation RepNVGoodsprings 0 3
	endif
end
